          "description": "Controls supported trajectory exports using session consent and sensitive-text redaction.",
          "locales": {
            "zh-CN": {
              "displayName": "遥测授权",
              "summary": "根据会话授权和敏感文本脱敏规则控制受支持的轨迹导出。",
              "description": "根据会话授权和敏感文本脱敏规则控制受支持的轨迹导出。"
